---
---

<section id="contato" class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="contact.eyebrow">Contato</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title" data-i18n="contact.title">Fale com Kelvin</h2>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="contact.desc">
        Entre em contato direto pelo WhatsApp ou e-mail. Possuímos experiência com infraestrutura SAP HANA,
        servidores críticos, cloud híbrida e adoção de inteligência artificial com governança.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-panel">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <h2 data-i18n="contact.more.title">Canais diretos</h2>
        <ul role="list" class="channel-list">
          <li class="channel-item whatsapp">
            <a href="https://wa.me/5511978356178" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="channel-link">
              <span class="channel-icon" aria-hidden="true">☎</span>
              <span class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.whatsapp">WhatsApp: +55 11 97835-6178</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="channel-item email">
            <a href="mailto:kelvinlener@protonmail.ch" class="channel-link">
              <span class="channel-icon" aria-hidden="true">✉</span>
              <span class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.email">kelvinlener@protonmail.ch</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="channel-item github">
            <a href="https://github.com/keltec-max/founders-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="channel-link">
              <span class="channel-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              <span class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.github">repositório no GitHub</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="contact-expertise">
          <h3 data-i18n="contact.expertise.title">Especialização em infraestrutura</h3>
          <ul role="list" class="expertise-list">
            <li data-i18n="contact.expertise.item0">Infraestrutura SAP HANA — servidores, storage e alta disponibilidade</li>
            <li data-i18n="contact.expertise.item1">Cloud híbrida: AWS, Azure, Google Cloud</li>
            <li data-i18n="contact.expertise.item2">Kubernetes, Terraform, Ansible e GitOps</li>
            <li data-i18n="contact.expertise.item3">IA generativa: Copilot, ChatGPT Enterprise, Claude, Llama</li>
            <li data-i18n="contact.expertise.item4">Observabilidade: Grafana, Prometheus, Datadog</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-state">
        <h3 data-i18n="contact.status.title">Status</h3>
        <p data-i18n="contact.status.active">Contato ativo. Resposta rápida via WhatsApp e e-mail.</p>
        <p data-i18n="contact.location">São Paulo, SP — Brasil</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .channel-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .channel-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .channel-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: none; font-size: .95rem; transition: color .2s; }
  .channel-link:hover { color: var(--color-gold); }
  .channel-icon { width: 24px; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-gold); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .channel-value { color: var(--color-muted); word-break: break-all; }
  .channel-link:hover .channel-value { color: var(--color-text); }

  .contact-expertise { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .contact-expertise h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .expertise-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .expertise-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .expertise-list li::before { content: '▹'; color: var(--color-gold); font-size: .7rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

  .contact-state h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .contact-state p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin-block: 8px 0; }
</style>